          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6fe674e6da231c72003b506c6f0b55c5e8aa270de8bbca1526e71e699e0daf99:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c1eb53df31ba4367a7389a71e4c7c0d0",
      "statement": "Dynamic UI operations are applied deterministically by sorting first on `sequence` and then `id`; a surface-level `replace` clears existing roots before inserting the new component, while component-targeted operations recursively replace the subtree matching `target_id`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/protocols/src/index.ts#L115-L166",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:aed6a88df04c828fd26d58a4387dbeea1d4bb97ad62b1e3a2a208dbb66ef653d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4b461b7d2e064300a6574aa808218dce",
      "statement": "Interactive question submissions are tightly validated against the last stored assistant question envelope: the backend only accepts schema version `1.0`, event `submit`, and action `question.answer`, caps free text at 1000 characters, requires the interaction, question, and turn identifiers to match the active question, verifies the component existed in the stored UI, enforces single-choice questions, and rejects unknown or duplicate selected options or empty answers.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://services/main-backend/internal/decision_memory/handler/interaction.go#L179-L284",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e2174d214545a9f1c52e76a52f1215ce18d913342ae7b3016a515803d32d483c:"
