      "id": "claim_ea477dbac5b04fc6a724337aeee6cc3f",
      "statement": "Session interactions are database-backed idempotent work records keyed by session and interaction ID: begin logic rejects reuse with a different payload hash, rejects still-leased pending work as in-progress, allows completed requests to replay the stored response envelope, and lets an expired lease be reacquired for the same payload.",
