      "statement": "Checkout pricing is backend-authoritative and VAT-inclusive: requested lines must specify exactly one of `product_id` or `retailer_offer_id`, product prices are reloaded from backend product quotes, consumer tax is fixed at zero because catalog prices are VAT-inclusive, and tests verify order unit prices and totals come from those official backend values rather than caller input.",
