      "id": "claim_e999a020035a41d094a81f70227898fa",
      "statement": "Retailer accessory checkout is both idempotent and backend-hydrated: any retailer offer line requires an `Idempotency-Key`, the service hashes the full payload to detect key reuse with different content, returns an existing idempotent order before refreshing retailer offers, and marks resulting orders as `PENDING_SUPPLIER_CONFIRMATION`.",
