    {
      "id": "claim_02a13fb11a7d43c8bff65f12812c0645",
      "statement": "Accessory offers follow an authoritative refresh split: ShopWise-owned bundle offers are loaded from backend storage, exposed only when compatible with one of the ordered products, may legitimately have zero price, and must not be externally refreshed; non-ShopWise retailer offers are refreshed at checkout, and if the refreshed price changes the backend persists the new snapshot and forces an explicit retry via `OfferChangedError`.",
