      "id": "claim_0fd24dfd9a104736ab09fdfb512faa78",
      "statement": "Resume tokens are single-use JWT-backed credentials with hashed server storage: issuance signs an HS256 token for 24 hours, stores only the SHA-256 hash plus token metadata, and revokes older unconsumed tokens for the same session before creating the new token.",
