      "id": "claim_e91e33be32b8430a94bce4d907d3a1f3",
      "statement": "Checkout promotions are session-scoped and idempotent per session: `StartPromotion` returns an existing promotion for the same session without restarting it, but checks user- or device-level cooldown eligibility across prior sessions before creating a new promotion.",
