    {
      "id": "claim_3f01cc9e59f3474f9c269333b022d143",
      "statement": "Promotion expiry and reward issuance are authoritative backend-time decisions: new promotions default to a 15-minute expiry and 30-day cooldown, `GetStatus` lazily flips overdue active promotions to `EXPIRED`, payment after expiry never issues a voucher, payment before expiry transitions to pending voucher issuance, and voucher-generation failures move the promotion into the only retryable state `ISSUE_RETRY_REQUIRED`.",
